        },
        {
          "label": {
            "zh": "磁场强度",
            "en": "Magnetic Field Strength"
          },
          "value": {
            "zh": "约 120 nT（感应磁场，由木星磁场与地下海洋相互作用产生）",
            "en": "~120 nT (induced field from interaction with Jupiter's magnetosphere and subsurface ocean)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": {
        "zh": "※ 木卫二极稀薄的氧气大气层并非生物来源，而是高能粒子轰击冰面将水分子分解为氢和氧，氢逸散后留下氧气。",
        "en": "※ Europa's tenuous oxygen atmosphere is not biological; it is produced by energetic particles splitting water molecules, with hydrogen escaping and oxygen retained."
      }
    },
