          "label": {
            "zh": "当前/最近任务",
            "en": "Current/Recent Mission"
          },
          "value": {
            "zh": "欧罗巴快船（Europa Clipper，NASA，2024 年发射，预计 2030 年到达）",
            "en": "Europa Clipper (NASA, launched 2024, expected arrival 2030)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": {
        "zh": "※ 欧罗巴快船任务将进行约 50 次近距离飞掠，携带九台科学仪器，旨在评估木卫二地下海洋的宜居性，但不会着陆。",
        "en": "※ The Europa Clipper mission will perform ~50 close flybys with nine science instruments to assess the habitability of Europa's subsurface ocean, but will not land."
